WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.120
Open the demo. No signup required. The workspace includes a sample portfolio.

2
00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:08.260
Choose Apple and enter two shares.

3
00:00:08.260 --> 00:00:12.501
Review the order and estimated cost before placing your trade.

4
00:00:12.501 --> 00:00:16.591
Confirm the buy. Two AAPL shares fill for $475.26 in virtual funds.

5
00:00:16.591 --> 00:00:21.727
Portfolio shows the new cash balance and 27 AAPL shares, up from 25.

6
00:00:21.727 --> 00:00:25.461
Return to Apple and choose Sell. One share is selected.

7
00:00:25.461 --> 00:00:29.580
Check the estimated credit for selling one share.

8
00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:33.748
Confirm the sell. One share fills for $237.51 in virtual funds.

9
00:00:33.748 --> 00:00:40.009
Activity shows both completed orders and their actual fill prices.
